    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   <- add if available
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - evidence localisation
  - retrieval evaluation
  - question answering
  - annotation completeness
  - evaluation methodology
abstract: >-
  Code, per-question result files and reproduction commands for a measurement study of
  evidence localisation inside the gold document in retrieval-augmented generation
  evaluation on QASPER and Natural Questions: seven localisers (BM25, four dense
  bi-encoders, two cross-encoder rerankers) under one protocol with an analytic,
  length-aware chance level; Holm-corrected paired tests and a document-level cluster
  bootstrap; union and rank-correlation analyses; admission-budget and chunk-size sweeps;
  and the scripts behind a human-reviewed failure-attribution study and a gold-span
  completeness adjudication. The human annotation package is deposited as a separate
  archive in the same Zenodo record.
preferred-citation:
